/-- **Strict convexity in convex position, with the labelled cyclic order.**

Every vertex `j` other than the endpoints of the edge `i → nxt i` lies strictly
to the left of that edge. Quantified over all `i j : Fin 16`, so no triple can
be missed: 256 cases, of which 32 are excluded by the hypotheses and the
remaining 224 are the certified determinants. -/
